---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import SourceCard from '../../components/SourceCard.astro';import {allNews,issues} from '../../lib/news';import {path} from '../../site';import {readingCandidates,candidateReason,latestNewsDate,editorPicks} from '../../lib/discovery';
const candidates=readingCandidates(allNews,latestNewsDate,5);
---
<Base title="值得一读 · 海波东" description="从近期资讯中按明确规则选出最多五条阅读候选，保留来源。"><h1 class="sr-only">精选资讯</h1><div class="content-toolbar"><span>{latestNewsDate} · {candidates.length} 条自动候选</span><a href={path('subscribe/')}>订阅 ↗</a></div><nav class="archive-date-strip" aria-label="按收录日期阅读"><span>按日期</span>{issues.slice(0,7).map(issue=><a href={path(`news/${issue.date}/`)}>{issue.date}</a>)}</nav>{editorPicks.length>0&&<section class="collection-section"><div class="section-title"><h2>作者精选</h2></div><div class="note-feed">{editorPicks.map(story=><div class="feed-item"><p class="candidate-reason">作者确认 · {story.editorReason}</p><SourceCard story={story} issue={story.issueDate}/></div>)}</div></section>}<details class="rule-panel"><summary>自动候选 · 如何入选？</summary><p>以最近收录日为基准，只考虑近七天、有较完整摘要、中文原文或完整中译可用的内容；按发布时间优先，尽量覆盖不同板块，每个来源最多一条，每次最多五条。过滤明显重复译文、版本发布日志。图片数量、访问量不参与排序。</p><p>这是规则筛选，不代表作者推荐，也不构成事实核验。作者确认的观点会单独署名发布。</p></details><section class="note-feed" aria-label="自动阅读候选">{candidates.map(story=><div class="feed-item"><small class="candidate-reason">{candidateReason(story)}</small><SourceCard story={story} issue={story.issueDate}/></div>)}</section>{!candidates.length&&<p class="reading-empty">这次没有符合条件的候选，可以直接查看全部资讯。</p>}</Base>
